  message: "Merged in PR #1415 (dev 1a7fcbff88). Integration: commits reordered pubin -> dahuh -> nakur so every commit is green; CI needed a schema-coverage baseline entry for the five values registered as pending (corpus has no LuaJIT FFI / N-API / Clojure multimethod code).\n\nFixed on jgstern-agent/fix/nakur (067fec6689).\n\n- **Before** (with a56cc21c1b's gate): `test_live_tree_producer_axis_ratchet` failed on the four values, and `check-producer-axis-coherence` exited 1.\n- **Fix:** all four registered AXIS_PENDING with no confidence seed, which leaves emitted confidence unchanged (both linkers pass explicit confidence). The fold to one pathway per linker plus a meta key is left to the cluster-C audit. The linkers' own tests now assert each value is registered. The tuple-return flow is followed by `value_flow`.\n- **After:** ratchet \"0 new leaks\".\n- **The sweep found** one more instance of the family (yaml_ansible `evidence_type=key`, four values, live-reproduced), filed as WI-janon-kifav-ritob-niduk-buduk-kapak-dunos-fudul.\n\n---"  # 05c6
